===============================================================================
SCOPE — what this licence does and does not cover
===============================================================================

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository
(src/, dashboard/, config/) and to the documentation (README.md, docs/).

It does NOT apply to the following, which are governed by their own terms:

  AMASS motion capture data
      Not contained in this repository. Distributed by the Max Planck Institute
      for Intelligent Systems under its own licence, which does not permit
      redistribution. https://amass.is.tue.mpg.de
      Mahmood et al., "AMASS: Archive of Motion Capture as Surface Shapes",
      ICCV 2019.

  SMPL-H body model ("Extended SMPL+H")
      Not contained in this repository. Same source and licence terms as AMASS,
      including the restriction on redistribution.

  Own recordings (sensor data, video, MediaPipe ground truth)
      The full recordings are NOT published: they contain identifiable video of
      participants who consented to use within this project only.
      data/sample/ contains a 90-second excerpt of the derived sensor and
      landmark data of one recording — numeric data only, no video — included
      so that the pipeline can be executed. It is covered by the MIT licence
      above but must not be used to attempt re-identification.

  MediaPipe Pose (Google)
      Used to produce the ground-truth landmarks. Apache License 2.0.
      Not redistributed here.

  results/ and docs/RESULTS.md
      Derived evaluation output of this project, covered by the MIT licence.

Anyone reusing this code for their own data is responsible for obtaining AMASS
and the SMPL-H body model directly from the Max Planck Institute and for
complying with those terms. src/synth/check_setup.py reports which of these
external assets are missing and where they are expected.
